<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 7,623 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 2,400 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  150   (200 and 240)</p>
<p>    Good		130   (130 and 155)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     118   (118 and 124)</p>
<p>    Medium	    112   (112 and  93)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 98   ( 98 and  80)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 150 pence for an Sri Lanka BOP.</p>
</text>
